sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
actor U as Presenter
 participant A as Controller / local journal
 participant API as Authorized Django API
 participant W as Cleanup worker / media
 Note over U,W: 8. Confirmed deletion and recovery | Planned
 U->>A: Delete attempt or deck
 A-->>U: Explain scope, deck includes its attempts<br/>and generated data
 alt Cancel
  U->>A: Cancel, preserve data
 else Confirm
  U->>A: Confirm target
  A->>A: Journal intent, stop playback/upload, hide<br/>target
  alt Local-only target
   A->>A: No server request required
  else Server-backed, offline or unreachable
   A->>A: Remove local copies, keep pending-server<br/>tombstone
   A-->>U: Local removal done, server deletion<br/>pending
  else Server-backed and reachable
   A->>API: DELETE attempt/deck with authenticated<br/>identity
   API->>API: Check owner, lock target, mark deleting,<br/>persist DeletionOperation + file manifest
   API-)W: Admit cleanup after commit
   API-->>A: Operation ID, pending
   Note over API,W: Block new child records/jobs/media reads.<br/>Workers check deletion before provider calls and final writes,<br/>discard late output. Queue cancellation alone is insufficient.
   W->>W: Reconcile reservations, remove dependent<br/>jobs/results/receipts
   alt Attempt target
    W->>W: Remove attempt, preserve deck + reusable<br/>descriptions
   else Deck target
    W->>W: Remove attempts, description dependencies,<br/>slides, then deck
    Note over API,W: Explicit dependency order resolves current PROTECT references.<br/>No silent change to current schema deletion policy.
   end
   W->>W: Delete manifest files idempotently
   alt File or cleanup failure
    W->>W: Retain remaining manifest + failure,<br/>schedule bounded retry
   else Server cleanup complete
    W->>W: Mark server complete, keep minimal<br/>operation tombstone
   end
   A->>API: Read operation status, retry pending<br/>request after reconnect
   API-->>A: Pending / retryable / server complete
  end
  A->>A: Purge local audio, results, checkpoints<br/>and unreferenced PDFs,<br/>record local cleanup progress, retry<br/>failed removals
  A-->>U: Complete only when applicable local +<br/>server work is done
 end
 Note over A,W: Other devices reconcile tombstones when online.<br/>Original files outside the app are untouched, retention policy remains open.
